    \item \textbf{Control \& Telemetry Bus:} Multi-drop SPI and I2C buses mapped to local micro-heater loops and internal monitoring thermal diodes.
    \item \textbf{Power Delivery Network (PDN):} Inductance-shielded rail paths delivering 0.85\,V core logic, 1.8\,V I/O, and 3.3\,V analog biasing lines.
\end{itemize}

